# Local bench working dirs. Large, machine-specific, never versioned.
# /firmware/: local firmware checkouts + built .bin artifacts (hundreds of MB)
# .kpi/: hil_kpi_report.py output
#
# Leading slash matters: an unanchored `firmware/` matches at ANY depth and
# silently swallowed configs/firmware/, the reviewed build recipes.
/firmware/
/.kpi/

